{"seq":1,"slug":"stretch-goal-threshold-refund","title":"达标/stretch goal/未达标退款","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/stretch-goal-threshold-refund","wordCount":2626,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"达标-stretch-goal-未达标退款\">达标/stretch goal/未达标退款</h1><p>众筹把&quot;可能失败&quot;写进了产品本身，而这句话在系统里必须被实现成一条<strong>可以精确判定的资金分叉</strong>。判定错了会同时得罪两边：把未达标判成达标，商家拿到一笔本该退回的钱却交不出货；把达标判成未达标，项目方白干一场、用户也拿不到想要的商品。这一篇讲达标判定的语义、stretch goal 的分层结构、以及未达标退款如何批量、幂等、可重放地执行。</p>\n<p>众筹与预售在监管眼中的分界，正是&quot;平台是否担保交付&quot;这一点。以 Kickstarter 为例，all-or-nothing 的含义是：项目在截止时间前未达到目标金额则不收取任何资金，平台不保证创作者会交付或按承诺使用资金，创作者若违反交付承诺则可能面临支持者的法律索赔（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kickstarter\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kickstarter</a> ）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>众筹的资金模型有三个层次，必须在数据模型上一开始就分开：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>层次</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>决定什么</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>承诺额 pledge</td>\n<td>用户表达的支持金额</td>\n<td>是否计入目标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标额 goal</td>\n<td>项目方设定的最低门槛</td>\n<td>资金是否放款</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>延伸目标 stretch</td>\n<td>高于目标的分层里程碑</td>\n<td>交付规格是否升级</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>pledge</code> 与 <code>goal</code> 的比较决定资金归属，这是硬约束；<code>stretch</code> 只影响交付内容，<strong>不影响资金归属</strong>。把 stretch 也做成&quot;未达到就退款&quot;的条件，会把一个交付规格问题升级成资金问题，是众筹实现里最常见的过度设计。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[活动进行中] --&gt; B[累计 pledge]&#10;    B --&gt; C{活动截止}&#10;    C --&gt; D{pledge &gt;= goal?}&#10;    D --&gt;|否| E[未达标路径]&#10;    D --&gt;|是| F[达标路径]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[取消授权/全额退款]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[项目标记 FAILED]&#10;    F --&gt; F1[放款给项目方]&#10;    F --&gt; F2[项目标记 FUNDED]&#10;    F --&gt; G{pledge &gt;= stretch_1?}&#10;    G --&gt;|是| H[交付规格升级到 tier1]&#10;    G --&gt;|否| I[按基础规格交付]\">graph TD\n    A[活动进行中] --&gt; B[累计 pledge]\n    B --&gt; C{活动截止}\n    C --&gt; D{pledge &gt;= goal?}\n    D --&gt;|否| E[未达标路径]\n    D --&gt;|是| F[达标路径]\n    E --&gt; E1[取消授权/全额退款]\n    E --&gt; E2[项目标记 FAILED]\n    F --&gt; F1[放款给项目方]\n    F --&gt; F2[项目标记 FUNDED]\n    F --&gt; G{pledge &gt;= stretch_1?}\n    G --&gt;|是| H[交付规格升级到 tier1]\n    G --&gt;|否| I[按基础规格交付]</pre><h2 id=\"达标判定的语义细节\">达标判定的语义细节</h2><h3 id=\"判定的三个时点\">判定的三个时点</h3><p>&quot;达标&quot;这个词在众筹流程里对应三个不同的时点，混用会造成严重的口径问题：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>截止时刻的达标</strong>：活动结束瞬间，<code>pledge</code> 是否达到 <code>goal</code>。这是决定资金归属的唯一判据。</li>\n<li><strong>放款时刻的达标</strong>：资金实际从托管账户转给项目方。它应当严格晚于截止时刻，且中间要经过一次对账确认。</li>\n<li><strong>履约时刻的达标</strong>：项目方是否真的交付了承诺的商品。它与前两者无关——达标后仍可能延期或失败。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>系统里应当有三个独立的字段记录这三个事实，而不是一个 <code>is_reached</code> 布尔值。理由在 <a href=\"../presale-order-inventory/presale-order-state-machine\">预售订单状态机</a> 中已经出现过的同一条原则：资金侧事实与履约侧事实必须解耦，否则一次达标判定错误会连带污染库存占用与排产计划。</p>\n<h3 id=\"取消-pledge-的处理\">取消 pledge 的处理</h3><p>用户在活动期间取消 pledge 是常态，它会让累计额下降。这带来一个判定时机的问题：如果系统在跟踪&quot;当前是否达标&quot;，那么一个项目可能今天达标、明天又不达标。正确的做法是<strong>不在活动期间做达标判定</strong>，只在截止时刻做一次。活动期间的展示只需要给出&quot;距目标还差多少&quot;，这是一种营销信息，不是资金决策。</p>\n<p>唯一的例外是<strong>实时放款的众筹</strong>（pledge 即扣款、达标即放款）。这类结构的资金风险完全转移给用户，在多数司法辖区会受到严格监管，因此不在本文讨论范围内；如果业务上确需支持，应当在产品层面明确它不属于 all-or-nothing 模型。</p>\n<h3 id=\"判定必须读权威明细\">判定必须读权威明细</h3><p>达标判定与第 1 章讲的&quot;聚合达标判定&quot;是同一类问题：必须读 pledge 明细致聚合，而不是读缓存计数。判定的结果要写成一条<strong>不可变事件</strong>，作为下游全部动作的唯一触发源。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE crowdfunding_campaign (&#10;  campaign_id   BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  currency      CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  goal_amount   NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL CHECK (goal_amount &gt; 0),&#10;  deadline_at   TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL,&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                CHECK (state IN (&#39;LIVE&#39;,&#39;DECIDED&#39;,&#39;FUNDED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;,&#39;SETTLED&#39;)),&#10;  UNIQUE (campaign_id)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE TABLE crowdfunding_pledge (&#10;  pledge_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  campaign_id   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES crowdfunding_campaign(campaign_id),&#10;  user_id       BIGINT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount        NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL CHECK (amount &gt; 0),&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                CHECK (state IN (&#39;PLEDGED&#39;,&#39;CANCELLED&#39;,&#39;CAPTURED&#39;,&#39;REFUNDED&#39;,&#39;RELEASED&#39;)),&#10;  pledged_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now()&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE UNIQUE INDEX uq_pledge_user_campaign&#10;  ON crowdfunding_pledge (campaign_id, user_id)&#10;  WHERE state = &#39;PLEDGED&#39;;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crowdfunding_campaign</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  goal_amount   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (goal_amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deadline_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'LIVE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DECIDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SETTLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (campaign_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> crowdfunding_pledge</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pledge_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_campaign(campaign_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  user_id       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PLEDGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CANCELLED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CAPTURED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'REFUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'RELEASED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pledged_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> uq_pledge_user_campaign</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_pledge (campaign_id, user_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'PLEDGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>最后这个部分唯一索引保证了同一用户在同一活动中只有一条活跃 pledge。它同时把&quot;重复承诺&quot;这个幂等问题挡在数据库层——用户连点两次提交、或者前端重试，都只会留下一条记录。</p>\n<p>判定本身是一次幂等的聚合写入：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO crowdfunding_decision (campaign_id, decided_at, total_pledged, outcome)&#10;SELECT&#10;  c.campaign_id,&#10;  c.deadline_at,&#10;  COALESCE(SUM(p.amount), 0),&#10;  CASE WHEN COALESCE(SUM(p.amount), 0) &gt;= c.goal_amount THEN &#39;FUNDED&#39; ELSE &#39;FAILED&#39; END&#10;FROM crowdfunding_campaign c&#10;LEFT JOIN crowdfunding_pledge p&#10;  ON p.campaign_id = c.campaign_id AND p.state IN (&#39;PLEDGED&#39;, &#39;CAPTURED&#39;)&#10;WHERE c.campaign_id = $1&#10;  AND c.deadline_at &lt;= now()&#10;GROUP BY c.campaign_id, c.deadline_at, c.goal_amount&#10;ON CONFLICT (campaign_id) DO NOTHING;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_decision (campaign_id, decided_at, total_pledged, outcome)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deadline_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">amount</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">goal_amount</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FUNDED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_campaign c</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LEFT JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_pledge p</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> p</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PLEDGED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'CAPTURED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deadline_at</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">deadline_at</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">goal_amount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CONFLICT (campaign_id) DO NOTHING;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ON CONFLICT (campaign_id) DO NOTHING</code> 让判定天然幂等：无论调度器触发多少次，只有第一次会写入。这是把幂等放在数据层而非应用层的又一个例子。</p>\n<h2 id=\"stretch-goal-的分层结构\">Stretch goal 的分层结构</h2><h3 id=\"延伸目标是交付规格-不是资金条件\">延伸目标是交付规格，不是资金条件</h3><p>延伸目标的设计目的是<strong>用确定的额外收入换取不确定的规格升级</strong>。它应当在 pledging 时就向用户披露：&quot;达到 X 金额，所有支持者额外获得 Y&quot;。关键点是：<strong>达到与否都不改变资金归属</strong>，也不产生退款义务。</p>\n<p>如果业务上确实希望&quot;未达 stretch 就退还差价&quot;，那它实际上是一个<strong>条件折扣</strong>而不是 stretch goal，两者的合同结构不同，必须用不同的数据模型表示。把它称作 stretch 而按条件折扣实现，是最容易引发集体投诉的命名误导。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分层的表示\">分层的表示</h3><p>延伸目标是天然的有序集合，应当用一张子表表示，每层带自己的金额门槛与交付增量。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE campaign_stretch_tier (&#10;  campaign_id   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES crowdfunding_campaign(campaign_id),&#10;  tier_no       INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (tier_no &gt; 0),&#10;  threshold     NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL CHECK (threshold &gt; 0),&#10;  deliverable   JSONB NOT NULL,&#10;  PRIMARY KEY (campaign_id, tier_no),&#10;  UNIQUE (campaign_id, threshold)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> campaign_stretch_tier</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_campaign(campaign_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  tier_no       </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (tier_no </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  threshold     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (threshold </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  deliverable   JSONB </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (campaign_id, tier_no),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (campaign_id, threshold)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNIQUE (campaign_id, threshold)</code> 保证不会出现两个门槛相同的层级——门槛重复会让&quot;达到哪一层&quot;变得不可判定。<code>deliverable</code> 用 JSONB 是因为交付增量在品类间差异极大（加一个配件、升级材质、增加一件），硬编码成列会导致每上一个新品类就改一次表。</p>\n<h3 id=\"层级的单调性\">层级的单调性</h3><p>层级必须满足单调性：<code>tier_no</code> 越大，<code>threshold</code> 越大，交付增量越&quot;多&quot;。这个约束无法用简单 CHECK 表达，应当在写入时校验，或者用一个触发器保证：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE OR REPLACE FUNCTION check_stretch_monotonic() RETURNS trigger AS $$&#10;BEGIN&#10;  IF EXISTS (&#10;    SELECT 1 FROM campaign_stretch_tier t&#10;    WHERE t.campaign_id = NEW.campaign_id&#10;      AND t.tier_no &lt; NEW.tier_no&#10;      AND t.threshold &gt;= NEW.threshold&#10;  ) THEN&#10;    RAISE EXCEPTION &#39;stretch tier threshold must increase with tier_no&#39;;&#10;  END IF;&#10;  RETURN NEW;&#10;END;&#10;$$ LANGUAGE plpgsql;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE OR REPLACE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FUNCTION</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> check_stretch_monotonic</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">() </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">RETURNS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trigger </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> $$</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BEGIN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  IF</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXISTS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> campaign_stretch_tier t</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NEW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">campaign_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier_no</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NEW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">tier_no</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">      AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">threshold</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> >=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> NEW</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">threshold</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">THEN</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    RAISE EXCEPTION </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'stretch tier threshold must increase with tier_no'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  END</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IF</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  RETURN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NEW;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">$$ </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LANGUAGE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> plpgsql;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>触发器的价值在于把一条业务规则变成<strong>无法被违反的结构约束</strong>。如果只在应用层校验，一次数据修复脚本或一次人工插入就会破坏它，而破坏后的表现是&quot;用户达到了 tier 2 却拿到 tier 1 的交付物&quot;这种极难追查的问题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"未达标退款的批量执行\">未达标退款的批量执行</h2><h3 id=\"执行顺序\">执行顺序</h3><p>未达标退款往往是数万笔同时发起，它的执行必须遵循一个明确的顺序，否则会出现资金与状态不一致：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[判定 FAILED] --&gt; B[锁定活动&lt;br/&gt;禁止新 pledge]&#10;    B --&gt; C[逐笔生成退款任务&lt;br/&gt;状态 PENDING]&#10;    C --&gt; D[调用支付通道退款]&#10;    D --&gt; E{通道结果}&#10;    E --&gt;|成功| F[pledge 置 REFUNDED]&#10;    E --&gt;|明确失败| G[重试队列&lt;br/&gt;指数退避]&#10;    E --&gt;|未知| H[标记 UNKNOWN&lt;br/&gt;进入对账]&#10;    G --&gt; D&#10;    H --&gt; I[对账任务查询通道]&#10;    I --&gt;|已退| F&#10;    I --&gt;|未退| G\">graph TD\n    A[判定 FAILED] --&gt; B[锁定活动&lt;br/&gt;禁止新 pledge]\n    B --&gt; C[逐笔生成退款任务&lt;br/&gt;状态 PENDING]\n    C --&gt; D[调用支付通道退款]\n    D --&gt; E{通道结果}\n    E --&gt;|成功| F[pledge 置 REFUNDED]\n    E --&gt;|明确失败| G[重试队列&lt;br/&gt;指数退避]\n    E --&gt;|未知| H[标记 UNKNOWN&lt;br/&gt;进入对账]\n    G --&gt; D\n    H --&gt; I[对账任务查询通道]\n    I --&gt;|已退| F\n    I --&gt;|未退| G</pre><p>顺序中两个关键点。第一，<strong>先锁定活动再退款</strong>，否则退款进行中还有新 pledge 进来，永远退不完。第二，<strong>&quot;未知&quot;必须是一个独立的结果类别</strong>。支付通道超时、网络中断时，钱可能已经退了也可能没退——把它当成失败重试，会造成重复退款；当成成功，会造成漏退。正确做法是标记未知并交给对账，这与超时重试的一般原则一致：超时并不意味着什么都没发生。</p>\n<h3 id=\"幂等与可重放\">幂等与可重放</h3><p>退款请求的幂等键应当由 <code>{campaign_id}:{pledge_id}</code> 构成，而不是随机数。这样即使整批任务被重跑，支付通道也能识别出重复请求。同时本地要有一条唯一的退款记录：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE pledge_refund (&#10;  refund_id     BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  pledge_id     BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES crowdfunding_pledge(pledge_id),&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL,&#10;  amount        NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL,&#10;  currency      CHAR(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  state         TEXT NOT NULL&#10;                CHECK (state IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;,&#39;SUCCEEDED&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;,&#39;UNKNOWN&#39;)),&#10;  attempt_count INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  last_error    TEXT,&#10;  updated_at    TIMESTAMPTZ NOT NULL DEFAULT now(),&#10;  UNIQUE (pledge_id),&#10;  UNIQUE (idempotency_key)&#10;);&#10;&#10;CREATE INDEX idx_refund_retry&#10;  ON pledge_refund (updated_at)&#10;  WHERE state IN (&#39;PENDING&#39;, &#39;UNKNOWN&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> pledge_refund</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  refund_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  pledge_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_pledge(pledge_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  currency      </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">                CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'SUCCEEDED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNKNOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  attempt_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  last_error    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  updated_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> now</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (pledge_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (idempotency_key)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> INDEX</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> idx_refund_retry</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> pledge_refund (updated_at)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> state</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> IN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'PENDING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'UNKNOWN'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNIQUE (pledge_id)</code> 保证一笔 pledge 只会有一条退款记录，这是&quot;不重复退款&quot;的硬保证。部分索引 <code>idx_refund_retry</code> 让重试扫描只触及待处理的行——退款表在活动结束后绝大部分行是终态，全表索引会成为纯粹的负担。</p>\n<h3 id=\"退款的批处理与限流\">退款的批处理与限流</h3><p>一次性向支付通道发起数万笔退款会被限流，也会造成通道侧的拥堵。标准做法是<strong>批处理加自适应限流</strong>：分批提交，每批观察成功与限流响应，按滑动窗口调整并发。这与重试策略的一般形式一致——退避延时可以建模为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = b^c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 为底数、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span></span></span></span></span> 为失败次数），在共享资源的场景下延迟必须被随机化，否则多个请求会同时重试并反复冲突；截断式二进制指数退避则给指数加上上限，避免延迟无限增长（见 <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exponential_backoff\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Exponential_backoff</a> ）。再叠加抖动（jitter）以避免所有批次在同一时刻重试造成同步冲击。</p>\n<p>这里的抖动不是可选项。数万笔退款如果都以相同的退避曲线重试，它们会在同一时刻一起回到通道，把一次短暂的限流放大成一次持续的拥塞。</p>\n<h2 id=\"达标后失败的边界情况\">达标后失败的边界情况</h2><p>达标之后项目方仍可能无法交付（产能崩了、供应商跑了）。这时的资金处理与前两种路径都不同：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>已放款</strong>：平台没有资金可退，只能协助追偿或提供平台承担的部分补偿。这也是为什么许多平台会保留一部分尾款在交付后才放给项目方——它在工程上表现为分阶段的放款计划。</li>\n<li><strong>未放款</strong>：直接走退款路径，与未达标相同。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判定&quot;是否已放款&quot;必须是一个可查询的事实，且放款本身要有幂等与对账保护：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE campaign_settlement (&#10;  settlement_id BIGSERIAL PRIMARY KEY,&#10;  campaign_id   BIGINT NOT NULL REFERENCES crowdfunding_campaign(campaign_id),&#10;  stage         INTEGER NOT NULL CHECK (stage &gt; 0),&#10;  amount        NUMERIC(14,2) NOT NULL CHECK (amount &gt; 0),&#10;  idempotency_key TEXT NOT NULL UNIQUE,&#10;  settled_at    TIMESTAMPTZ,&#10;  UNIQUE (campaign_id, stage)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> campaign_settlement</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settlement_id </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGSERIAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  campaign_id   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> REFERENCES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> crowdfunding_campaign(campaign_id),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  stage         </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INTEGER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (stage </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  amount        </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NUMERIC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">14</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CHECK</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (amount </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  idempotency_key </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  settled_at    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMPTZ</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (campaign_id, stage)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>UNIQUE (campaign_id, stage)</code> 让分阶段放款不可能重复执行同一阶段——这是分阶段放款能安全实现的核心约束。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>承诺额、目标额、延伸目标是三个层次；只有承诺额与目标额的比较决定资金归属。</li>\n<li>达标对应三个不同时点（截止、放款、履约），必须是三个独立字段。</li>\n<li>活动期间不做达标判定，只做一次截止时刻判定，结果是不可变事件。</li>\n<li>延伸目标是交付规格而非资金条件；若要实现条件折扣，必须用不同的模型与命名。</li>\n<li>延伸目标层级需要单调性约束，用触发器让它成为不可违反的结构约束。</li>\n<li>批量退款要先把活动锁定，再逐笔执行，且&quot;未知&quot;必须是独立结果类别而非失败。</li>\n<li>退款幂等键由活动与 pledge 构成，本地以 <code>UNIQUE (pledge_id)</code> 硬保证不重退。</li>\n<li>重试必须叠加抖动，避免数万笔退款同步重试放大通道拥塞。</li>\n<li>分阶段放款用 <code>UNIQUE (campaign_id, stage)</code> 保证同一阶段不会重复执行。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>达标的承诺日期滑移后如何通知与赔付，见 <a href=\"delay-notice-compensation\">延期发货通知与赔付</a>；达标之前该备多少货，见 <a href=\"presale-demand-uncertainty-supply\">需求不确定下的供应与超卖防控</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"达标/stretch goal/未达标退款","id":"达标-stretch-goal-未达标退款"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"达标判定的语义细节","id":"达标判定的语义细节"},{"level":3,"text":"判定的三个时点","id":"判定的三个时点"},{"level":3,"text":"取消 pledge 的处理","id":"取消-pledge-的处理"},{"level":3,"text":"判定必须读权威明细","id":"判定必须读权威明细"},{"level":2,"text":"Stretch goal 的分层结构","id":"stretch-goal-的分层结构"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸目标是交付规格，不是资金条件","id":"延伸目标是交付规格-不是资金条件"},{"level":3,"text":"分层的表示","id":"分层的表示"},{"level":3,"text":"层级的单调性","id":"层级的单调性"},{"level":2,"text":"未达标退款的批量执行","id":"未达标退款的批量执行"},{"level":3,"text":"执行顺序","id":"执行顺序"},{"level":3,"text":"幂等与可重放","id":"幂等与可重放"},{"level":3,"text":"退款的批处理与限流","id":"退款的批处理与限流"},{"level":2,"text":"达标后失败的边界情况","id":"达标后失败的边界情况"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预售订单状态机与尾款支付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/presale-order-inventory/presale-order-state-machine"},"next":{"title":"延期发货通知与赔付","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/presale-crowdfunding-order/crowdfunding-goal-risk/delay-notice-compensation"}}